    "en": {
      "trackName": "Offline Watch Games",
      "description": "Classic games, ready to play on your wrist and your iPhone.\n\nDiscover a collection of games for Apple Watch and iPhone. From familiar arcade challenges to puzzles that make you think, open the app and find a game for the moment.\n\nCommand a tank and defend your base, weave through turns in Snake, aim your shots to break bricks, or find your way through box puzzles, mazes and matching challenges. Explore tower defense, racing, pool, pinball and more. Whether you want to test your reflexes or take your time with a puzzle, there’s plenty to enjoy.\n\nDesigned for the small screen of Apple Watch, the interface and controls turn your wrist into a portable arcade. Different games use taps, swipes or the Digital Crown, with distinctive sound effects and haptic feedback that bring each session to life. For a bigger view, open the app on your iPhone and enjoy the games there too.\n\nPlay without an internet connection. On your commute, while waiting in line or during a short break, a quick game can make a spare moment more enjoyable.\n\nTake the classics with you. Play whenever you’re ready.\n\nSubscriptions and Purchases\n\nThe app offers weekly, monthly and yearly memberships, with subscription periods of one week, one month and one year respectively. An active subscription unlocks the full game collection.\n\nPrices are shown on the purchase screen and Apple’s purchase confirmation. Payment will be charged to your Apple account when you confirm your purchase.\n\nSubscriptions renew automatically unless canceled at least 24 hours before the current subscription period ends. Apple will charge your account for renewal within 24 hours before the end of the current period. A successful renewal extends your access for another subscription period.\n\nYou can manage or cancel your subscription on your iPhone by going to Settings → Apple Account → Subscriptions. After cancellation, your access remains available until the end of the current paid period. \n\nTerms of Use:\nhttps://game.tongtouok.xyz/terms/\n\nPrivacy Policy:\nhttps://game.tongtouok.xyz/privacy/",
      "releaseNotes": "• Added 10+ games for more ways to play and more choices. \n• Expanded game content and challenges. \n• Improved difficulty progression and controls.",
